CMTL 3D Assets: license

This repository mixes our own work with third-party parts. Each keeps its own license.

1. CMTL originals

   00_design-rules/, 07_hardware/, 08_cutouts/, and the starter-box_* files in
   09_enclosures/ were made by Kyle Smith for the Creative Music Technology Lab
   (CMTL) at Georgia Tech. They are licensed under the Creative Commons
   Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

   Anything contributed to 10_cmtl-originals/ is shared under the same license
   by its contributor.

   Credit it as: "CMTL 3D Assets, Creative Music Technology Lab, Georgia Tech".

2. Third-party parts

   Every adafruit_*, espressif_*, and kiswitch_* folder keeps its upstream license.
   ATTRIBUTION.md lists each one with its source and license, and the full
   license texts are in LICENSES/:

   - Adafruit parts: MIT (LICENSES/MIT-Adafruit.txt)
   - Espressif modules: CC BY-SA 4.0 with the KiCad library exception
     (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0-Espressif.md)
   - kiswitch parts: MIT (LICENSES/MIT-kiswitch.txt) or CC BY-SA 4.0
     (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0-kiswitch.txt), your choice

Everything here is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.
